The corpus in data/ contains outputs generated by Llama-3.3-70B,
Qwen-2.5-72B, DeepSeek-V3 and GPT-4o-mini, obtained through the OpenAI and
OpenRouter APIs. The CC BY 4.0 grant above covers the authors' selection,
